abstract: >-
  A data report on memory, safety, pricing and platform risk across 10 AI companion and character chat apps (Character.AI, Chai, PolyBuzz, Janitor AI, Replika, Nomi, Talkie, Kindroid, SpicyChat and ChatBrat AI), built from October 2026 filings, help centers and public trackers. Includes comparison tables as CSV and five charts.
